				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1510,
				6
			],
			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Add logsPath to sandbox config, clean up handlers\n\nAdd the required `logsPath` field to `ISandboxConfiguration` to prevent VS Code's `NativeWorkbenchEnvironmentService.logsHome` from resolving to `undefined`, which crashes the extension host with a `TypeError` in `path.join`. The path is derived from `AppDataDir/logs/<session-timestamp>`, created eagerly before constructing the sandbox object.\n\nRemove the `nativeHost:setDocumentEdited` handler body — `NSWindow::setDocumentEdited` is not exposed by Tauri 2.x's `WebviewWindow` API — and strip the unused `ping_timeout` field from `ConnectionHealthChecker` since health checks are now call-path-driven rather than timer-based.\n\nSimplify early-return control flow in `isPortFree` and `getTerminalProcessId` to reduce branch nesting and eliminate dead returns. Fix the `TerminalId` type in `ResizeTerminal` with an explicit `.into()` conversion.\n\nRedraw the README architecture diagram as a structured subsystem hierarchy (Binary/, Track/, RunTime/, IPC/, Vine/, RPC/) with accurate gRPC port annotations for the Cocoon (:50052) and Air (:50053) sidecars.\n\nAdd `MIRIFLAGS=-Zmiri-disable-isolation` to `.cargo/config.toml` to permit `_NSGetExecutablePath` calls during Miri testing.",
			"SHA": "0644dc0e1c7ea10717d827c6f4bdbde334d3da45"
		},
